  "title": "An Explicit 98-Clause Linear Monotone NAE-4 Equality Gadget",
  "batch_label": "60",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "For every finite indexed monotone 4-uniform NAE instance F=(V;(C_j)_{j=1}^m) with four distinct unnegated variables in each clause, replacing every indexed occurrence by a fresh occurrence variable and joining it to the original variable with the explicit 98-clause PG(3,3)-subcore equality gadget in evidence/gadget-proof.md produces a monotone 4-uniform linear NAE instance F'. The satisfying assignments of F' project onto V exactly as Sat(F), every satisfying assignment of F extends to F', and every satisfying assignment of F' restricts to one of F. The construction uses 39 fresh variables and 98 gadget clauses per occurrence, hence n+156m variables and 393m clauses in total, runs in linear time, and satisfies all five frozen assertions with the absolute local bound B=98.",
  "gate_basis": "Current released terminal, manifest, PDF, TeX freeze, snapshot files, provenance and four audits agree.",
